**Fifth street:** you get the **2♠** face up. That's no help, but you still have two pair, kings and nines. The house gets the **Q♦** face up, so it's showing 7♣ 7♦ Q♦. Its pair of sevens is still the best showing hand, so it acts first, and this time it **bets 20**. The pot is now **80**.

