{"a2uiMeta":{"note":"**Seventh street:** your last card is dealt face down, and it's the **3♣**. You still have two pair, kings and nines. The house gets its last card face down. It acts first and **bets 20**, and you call, as you asked. The pot is now **140**.

**Showdown:** the house turns over 4♥ Q♣ and has 8♥ as its last card. That gives it two pair, queens and sevens.

**You win the 140-chip pot with two pair, kings and nines (K♠ K♦ 9♥ 9♣ 5♥).** The house had queens and sevens (Q♣ Q♦ 7♣ 7♦ J♠). You're up 70 chips this round, so your bankroll is now **1,070**.","target":{"surfaceId":"table-1"},"trace":{"turnIndex":8,"query":{"intent":"Check, or call if there is a bet.","k":3},"exemplarIds":["domain-croupier-card-table-round","booking-reservation","frontier-button-icon-actions"],"rounds":1,"healed":0,"failureCodes":["TEXT_JSONL_IGNORED"],"model":"claude-opus-5-5","prompt":{"limit":142000,"total":56808,"sections":[{"id":"grammar","chars":25630},{"id":"components","chars":20517},{"id":"functions","chars":145},{"id":"few-shot","chars":4839},{"id":"mini-skills","chars":755},{"id":"persona","chars":4922}],"over":false},"usage":{"inputTokens":8035,"outputTokens":2323,"cacheReadInputTokens":17522,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0},"miniSkillIds":["game-hud"],"cacheBoundary":46292}}}

